# Written into the repository root by the turn contract in prompt.md, at the end of a
# turn, and `git add -A` would otherwise commit both. Ignored rather than relocated so
# the contract's commands stay runnable verbatim from the root, like the two above; the
# next turn's `git clean -fdx` removes them, so neither can go stale.
turn.diff
dismissed.md
